---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — JSDC Wheels">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-dark-400 mb-8">Last updated: May 6, 2025</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-dark-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">1. About Our Service</h2>
        <p>
          JSDC Wheels ("we", "us", "our") is a tire and wheel distributor
          serving both retail customers and wholesale accounts in the Greater Toronto Area,
          Ontario, Canada.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <strong class="text-white">Retail customers</strong> can browse and purchase tires and wheels
          at our listed prices (supplier MSRP less 10%).
          <strong class="text-white">Wholesale accounts</strong> (registered tire shops, automotive retailers,
          and sub-distributors) receive additional discounted pricing after signing in.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          To inquire about wholesale account registration, please <a href="/gtatire/contact" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline">contact us</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">2. Pricing and Taxes</h2>
        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mb-2">Prices Exclude HST</h3>
        <p>
          All prices displayed on this website are in Canadian dollars (CAD) and
          <strong class="text-white">exclude Harmonized Sales Tax (HST)</strong>.
          HST at the applicable rate (currently 13%) will be applied
          to all purchases at time of invoicing.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mt-4 mb-2">Prices Subject to Change</h3>
        <p>
          Displayed prices are subject to change without notice. Prices shown on this website
          are for reference only. The price confirmed at time of order placement governs the
          transaction. We reserve the right to correct pricing errors.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mt-4 mb-2">Compare-At (Strikethrough) Prices</h3>
        <p>
          Where a strikethrough "compare-at" price is displayed alongside a product price, that
          figure represents the manufacturer's suggested retail price (MSRP) as provided by the
          manufacturer or supplier at the time of data collection. Compare-at prices are for
          reference only and do not represent our regular or previous selling price.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-white font-medium mt-4 mb-2">Distributor Pricing</h3>
        <p>
          Registered distributors with an active account may be shown wholesale pricing tiers
          after logging in. Wholesale pricing is confidential and must not be shared publicly
          or with non-authorized parties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">3. Product Availability and Stock</h2>
        <p>
          Stock levels displayed on this website are approximate and updated periodically. They
          do not constitute a guarantee of availability at time of order. Actual inventory is
          confirmed at time of order placement. We are not liable for losses arising from
          displayed stock levels that differ from actual availability.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Product listings, specifications, images, and descriptions are provided for reference.
          While we make reasonable efforts to ensure accuracy, we cannot guarantee that all
          product information is current, complete, or error-free.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">4. No Online Ordering</h2>
        <p>
          This website does not currently support online ordering or payment processing.
          All orders must be placed by contacting us directly:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3">
          <a href="mailto:james@jsdcwheels.ca" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            james@jsdcwheels.ca
          </a>
          &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          <a href="/gtatire/contact" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            Contact Form
          </a>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Browsing products on this website does not constitute placing an order or create
          any binding obligation on either party.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">5. Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          All products are sold subject to the manufacturer's warranty terms. JSDC Wheels
          Distributor does not provide independent warranties beyond those offered by the
          manufacturer. Warranty claims must be directed to the manufacturer per their
          published warranty policy.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          We make no representations or warranties, express or implied, regarding fitness for
          a particular purpose, merchantability, or the accuracy of manufacturer specifications.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">6. Returns and Exchanges</h2>
        <p>
          Returns and exchanges are accepted only with prior written authorization from GTA
          Tire Distributor. To request a return authorization, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:james@jsdcwheels.ca" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline">
            james@jsdcwheels.ca
          </a>
          before returning any product.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">Products returned without authorization will not be accepted.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Eligible returns must be in original, unused, resalable condition with original
          packaging. Products that have been mounted, used, or damaged are not eligible for return.
          Restocking fees may apply.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, JSDC Wheels shall not
          be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages
          arising from your use of this website or purchase of products, including but not
          limited to: loss of profits, loss of data, business interruption, or damage arising
          from product fitment decisions made based on information displayed on this website.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Vehicle fitment data, tire size recommendations, and wheel specifications displayed
          on this website are provided for reference only. You are responsible for verifying
          that products are appropriate for your customer's specific vehicle before installation.
          Always consult the vehicle manufacturer's specifications.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Our total liability to you for any claim shall not exceed the amount paid by you
          for the specific product giving rise to the claim.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">8. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Product images, brand logos, and trademarks displayed on this website are the
          property of their respective manufacturers and suppliers. JSDC Wheels does
          not claim ownership of third-party brand assets. Vehicle imagery is provided by
          IMAGIN.studio under license.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The website design, layout, and original content are owned by JSDC Wheels.
          Unauthorized reproduction or commercial use is prohibited.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">9. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of
          the Province of Ontario and the federal laws of Canada applicable therein. Any
          disputes arising from these terms or your use of this website shall be subject to
          the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Ontario.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. The "Last updated"
          date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of this
          website after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-dark-900 border border-dark-700/50 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">11. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these Terms of Service? Contact us:</p>
        <div class="mt-3 space-y-1">
          <p><strong class="text-white">JSDC Wheels</strong></p>
          <p>Scarborough, Ontario, Canada</p>
          <p>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:james@jsdcwheels.ca" class="text-primary-400 hover:underline">
              james@jsdcwheels.ca
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
